ust trim clips — they establish authority, trigger emotions, and drive action."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6","children":"At ZeenOx, we don't just edit — we strategize. Before cutting a single frame, we analyze the platform's current algorithm trends, your brand's unique voice, and your audience's behavior patterns. If we are producing ad creatives for paid campaigns, we ensure the pacing aligns with conversion psychology. If we are editing educational content for a clinic, we focus on clarity, trust signals, and professional presentation."}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 mt-10","children":"Our Video Editing Process (Step-by-Step)"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"We operate a streamlined post-production pipeline that guarantees fast turnarounds without compromising our premium quality bar:"}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"space-y-3 text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Step 1 — Discovery:"}]," We understand your brand, target audience, platform goals, and content style."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Step 2 — Footage Review:"}]," Our editors review all raw footage and identify the strongest moments to build around."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Step 3 — Edit Assembly:"}]," We apply strategic pacing, music selection, and narrative arc to create the first cut."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Step 4 — Motion & Sound Design:"}]," Captions, color grading, sound effects, and music are layered in for full polish."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Step 5 — Review & Revisions:"}]," You get 2 rounds of revisions to perfect the final output."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Step 6 — Final Delivery:"}]," Files delivered in your preferred platform 